cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Superdiffusion: a Lean 4 formalization of superdiffusion and anomalous regularization in self-similar random incompressible flows"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / mathlib formalization of the PDE theory of
  superdiffusion in self-similar random incompressible flows: the
  superdiffusive asymptotics of the effective diffusivity, the
  renormalization of the generator (Theorem B), and the anomalous
  large-scale regularity theory (Theorem C), built on the public
  CoarseGraining homogenization library.  The development contains no sorry
  and no custom axiom.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Armstrong
    given-names: Scott
  - family-names: Kuusi
    given-names: Tuomo
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - superdiffusion
  - stochastic homogenization
  - partial differential equations
license: Apache-2.0
